From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:02:17 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Show full badge and admin dashboard totals

Events with no spots left get a "Lotado" badge in the listing and in
the show page. The admin dashboard shows the total of events and
enrollments, computed on each request.
